{"cues":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":15.6},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":16.36,"end":28},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":30.08,"end":42.4}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":3.12,"text":"布林邏輯用兩種狀態表示真與假。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":3.68,"end":7.04,"text":"數位電路利用這個抽象可靠地組合條件。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":7.68,"end":10.4,"text":"門鎖中 A、B 是授權輸入，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":10.8,"end":11.84,"text":"C 是警報；"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":12.48,"end":13.76,"text":"這是邏輯練習，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":13.88,"end":15.6,"text":"不是安全的認證系統。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":16.36,"end":18.48,"text":"分別切換 A、B、C，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":18.72,"end":20.48,"text":"觀察 0/1 值。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":20.8,"end":22.16,"text":"從警報關閉開始，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":22.48,"end":24.56,"text":"辨認目前邏輯閘模式。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":25.28,"end":28,"text":"一個布林輸入有幾種可能狀態？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":30.08,"end":32.88,"text":"一個布林輸入有幾種可能狀態？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":35.28,"end":39.36,"text":"請根據剛才測試的模型或程式選擇答案。"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":39.92,"end":42.4,"text":"回饋會說明不同選項的差異。"}]}